.git
.github
.claude
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.venv
venv
env

# Local store / generated artifacts -- never belong in a server image
memory/
benchmark/
tests/
assets/

# The client package stays out of the server image -- with two exceptions.
# hub/commons.py imports commontrace.overlap for MinHash, because client and
# server signatures are only comparable if both draw the SAME permutations;
# a near-copy that drifted by one constant would return confident, wrong
# similarity numbers instead of failing. Excluding the contents rather than
# the directory itself, so the negations below can re-include specific files
# (an excluded *directory* is never traversed, so `!commontrace/x.py` under
# a bare `commontrace/` rule would not match).
commontrace/**
!commontrace/__init__.py
!commontrace/overlap.py

# Secrets must come from the platform's secret store, never be baked in
.env
hub/.env
*.env
!hub/.env.example
